==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|Ablen}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|fr|ablet}}, {{m|fr|ablette}}, a diminutive from {{der|en|LL.|abula}}, for {{m|la|albula}}, diminutive of {{m|la|albus||white}}. Compare [[abele]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small [[fresh-water]] fish ({{taxfmt|Alburnus alburnus|species}}); the [[bleak]].

